</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="oead044-tblfn11"><p>One patient died before follow-up and was therefore excluded.</p></fn><fn id="oead044-tblfn12"><p>MBF, myocardial blood flow; MFR, myocardial flow reserve; RFR, relative flow reserve. Bold <italic toggle="yes">P</italic>-values indicate <italic toggle="yes">P</italic> &#x0003c; 0.05.</p></fn><fn id="oead044-tblfn13"><label>a</label><p>If a patient was revascularized in multiple coronary arteries, the mean MPI values are inserted for all treated vessels.</p></fn><fn id="oead044-tblfn14"><label>b</label><p>The defect size is the mean size including all participants without defects.</p></fn><fn id="oead044-tblfn15"><label>c</label><p>Proportion in %.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap position="float" id="oead044-T5"><label>Table 5</label><caption><p>Diagnostic value of quantitative MPI on PCI procedure and subsequent angina relief</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><colgroup span="1"><col valign="top" align="left" span="1"/><col valign="top" align="left" span="1"/><col align="char" char="." span="1"/><col valign="top" align="left" span="1"/><col valign="top" align="left" span="1"/><col valign="top" align="left" span="1"/><col valign="top" align="left" span="1"/><col valign="top" align="left" span="1"/></colgroup><thead><tr><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Parametric variables</th><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">AUC</th><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
